<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NICKY OPPENHEIMER XI.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NICKY OPPENHEIMER XI.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat the Nicky Oppenheimer XI by 19 runs in their one-day cricket match at Randjesfontein on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia 284-6 declared (Matthew Elliot 91, Steve Waugh 72 retired, Matthew Hayden 60)</p>
<p>Nicky Oppenheimer XI: 265 all out (Neil McKenzie 133)</p>
